[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15291.189, "timestamp": "04:14:51", "text": "我可能要死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15292.87, "timestamp": "04:14:52", "text": "你在哪裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15294.469, "timestamp": "04:14:54", "text": "？  我在樓下，聽到「哎呀」一聲。我死了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15297.03, "timestamp": "04:14:57", "text": "。我死了。我死了。我死了。我死了。我可能會死。我嚇壞了。我嚇壞了。"}]